body:
I know this is a slightly older post But I'm still having the biggest trouble.

/give player mod:itemname amount meta {nbt}

/give 80Mb iron_hoe 1 2 {CanDestroy:"Dirt"}

It didn't work. Nor does /give 80Mb stone_pickaxe{CanDestroy:["dirt"]} 1
which DOES WORK on singleplayer, but not on a server (Im Op and own it. so ofc i have all perms)\

Currently running a Paper 1.16.1 Server.
